## Display image / video

```tsx
import { AdvancedImage, AdvancedVideo } from '@cloudinary/react';
import { fill } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/actions/resize';
import { format, quality } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/actions/delivery';
import { auto } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/qualifiers/format';
import { auto as autoQuality } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/qualifiers/quality';

const img = cld.image('samples/cloudinary-icon')
  .resize(fill().width(800).height(600))
  .delivery(format(auto()))
  .delivery(quality(autoQuality()));

<AdvancedImage cldImg={img} />

// Video (same pattern)
<AdvancedVideo cldVid={cld.video('samples/elephants')} controls />
```

`format` and `quality` must be **separate** `.delivery()` calls. Always add both at the end unless a specific format/quality is needed.

