## Transformation quick reference

URL structure: `https://res.cloudinary.com/{{CLOUD_NAME}}/image/upload/<transforms>/<public_id>`

Always end with `f_auto/q_auto` as the final URL components. Commas separate params within a step; slashes separate steps.
